    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Eros Raiders, the ultimate fusion of waifus, sci-fi, mechas and hentai!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/4fc1501a0332c0d978b030bbf2e271b4.poster.avif?t=1738233278\" width=616 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/4fc1501a0332c0d978b030bbf2e271b4.webm?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/4fc1501a0332c0d978b030bbf2e271b4.mp4?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and train your team of beautiful full animated female pilots and explore pretty hot stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/f4ffe957e41be546f47b0e504fb277fc.poster.avif?t=1738233278\" width=616 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/f4ffe957e41be546f47b0e504fb277fc.webm?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/f4ffe957e41be546f47b0e504fb277fc.mp4?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for thrilling 5 vs. 5 3D turn-based mecha battles, piloted by stunning women who want nothing more than to get in your sheets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/e181cbe3b6c04348503cd1225e55ff98.poster.avif?t=1738233278\" width=616 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/e181cbe3b6c04348503cd1225e55ff98.webm?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/e181cbe3b6c04348503cd1225e55ff98.mp4?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of anime, RPGs, JRPGs and mechas, Eros Raiders offers a rich and, above all, attractive experience that will keep you hooked for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/5fc2e08934a306b45ce6e0bc62b9131f.poster.avif?t=1738233278\" width=616 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/5fc2e08934a306b45ce6e0bc62b9131f.webm?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/5fc2e08934a306b45ce6e0bc62b9131f.mp4?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/85cd5172dac783cbdebfd10e38a1b1f3.poster.avif?t=1738233278\" width=616 height=574 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/85cd5172dac783cbdebfd10e38a1b1f3.webm?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/85cd5172dac783cbdebfd10e38a1b1f3.mp4?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit and Train Your Waifus</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Waifus: Recruit a diverse cast of Waifus, each with unique abilities, personalities and \u201c tastes\u201d. From fierce warriors to cunning strategists, find the perfect team for your play style, or simply choose the ones that warm your heart (or ANY other part of your body) the most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training and Enhancement: Train your pilots to improve their power and performance in combat. Develop their skills, unlock new abilities, and customize their appearance to suit your &quot;preferences&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Combats: Turn-Based Action: Plan and execute strategies to defeat your opponents in intense 5v5 battles. Use your tactical prowess to outmaneuver and outsmart your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant Mechas: Unleash the power of your mechas and use special abilities to turn the tide of battle. Command awe-inspiring robots equipped with cutting-edge technology and devastating weaponry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Battles: Experience immersive 3D combat with stunning visual effects. Enjoy dynamic, action-packed battles that bring the excitement of mecha warfare to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure Mode: Experience the main story and discover the secrets of the cosmos. Participate in epic missions, get to know your soldiers intimately and immerse yourself in a narrative that encompasses all the stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mode: Face unique daily challenges to test your skills. Every day brings new obstacles and rewards, pushing you to strategize and adapt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >League Mode (PvP): Battle other players, climb the ranks, and earn exclusive rewards. Prove your worth in competitive matches and rise to the top of the leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Event Mode: Participate in limited-time events with thematic side stories and special rewards. Celebrate seasons and holidays with unique challenges and exclusive content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Experience</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Quality Graphics: Enjoy stunning visual effects and fluid animations. Marvel at the detailed environments, explosive battle sequences, beautiful character designs and the \u201cinteresting\u201d situations in which they end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative: Immerse yourself in a rich and captivating story that will keep you on the edge (of your seat, of course).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a universe full of mystery, danger and adventure, alongside your beloved girls who will help you when you need it, if you do the same for them, of course.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Eros Raiders, the ultimate fusion of waifus, sci-fi, mechas and hentai!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/4fc1501a0332c0d978b030bbf2e271b4.poster.avif?t=1738233278\" width=616 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/4fc1501a0332c0d978b030bbf2e271b4.webm?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/4fc1501a0332c0d978b030bbf2e271b4.mp4?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and train your team of beautiful full animated female pilots and explore pretty hot stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/f4ffe957e41be546f47b0e504fb277fc.poster.avif?t=1738233278\" width=616 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/f4ffe957e41be546f47b0e504fb277fc.webm?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/f4ffe957e41be546f47b0e504fb277fc.mp4?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for thrilling 5 vs. 5 3D turn-based mecha battles, piloted by stunning women who want nothing more than to get in your sheets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/e181cbe3b6c04348503cd1225e55ff98.poster.avif?t=1738233278\" width=616 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/e181cbe3b6c04348503cd1225e55ff98.webm?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/e181cbe3b6c04348503cd1225e55ff98.mp4?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of anime, RPGs, JRPGs and mechas, Eros Raiders offers a rich and, above all, attractive experience that will keep you hooked for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/5fc2e08934a306b45ce6e0bc62b9131f.poster.avif?t=1738233278\" width=616 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/5fc2e08934a306b45ce6e0bc62b9131f.webm?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/5fc2e08934a306b45ce6e0bc62b9131f.mp4?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/85cd5172dac783cbdebfd10e38a1b1f3.poster.avif?t=1738233278\" width=616 height=574 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/85cd5172dac783cbdebfd10e38a1b1f3.webm?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286700/extras/85cd5172dac783cbdebfd10e38a1b1f3.mp4?t=1738233278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit and Train Your Waifus</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Waifus: Recruit a diverse cast of Waifus, each with unique abilities, personalities and \u201c tastes\u201d. From fierce warriors to cunning strategists, find the perfect team for your play style, or simply choose the ones that warm your heart (or ANY other part of your body) the most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training and Enhancement: Train your pilots to improve their power and performance in combat. Develop their skills, unlock new abilities, and customize their appearance to suit your &quot;preferences&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Combats: Turn-Based Action: Plan and execute strategies to defeat your opponents in intense 5v5 battles. Use your tactical prowess to outmaneuver and outsmart your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant Mechas: Unleash the power of your mechas and use special abilities to turn the tide of battle. Command awe-inspiring robots equipped with cutting-edge technology and devastating weaponry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Battles: Experience immersive 3D combat with stunning visual effects. Enjoy dynamic, action-packed battles that bring the excitement of mecha warfare to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure Mode: Experience the main story and discover the secrets of the cosmos. Participate in epic missions, get to know your soldiers intimately and immerse yourself in a narrative that encompasses all the stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mode: Face unique daily challenges to test your skills. Every day brings new obstacles and rewards, pushing you to strategize and adapt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >League Mode (PvP): Battle other players, climb the ranks, and earn exclusive rewards. Prove your worth in competitive matches and rise to the top of the leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Event Mode: Participate in limited-time events with thematic side stories and special rewards. Celebrate seasons and holidays with unique challenges and exclusive content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Experience</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Quality Graphics: Enjoy stunning visual effects and fluid animations. Marvel at the detailed environments, explosive battle sequences, beautiful character designs and the \u201cinteresting\u201d situations in which they end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative: Immerse yourself in a rich and captivating story that will keep you on the edge (of your seat, of course).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a universe full of mystery, danger and adventure, alongside your beloved girls who will help you when you need it, if you do the same for them, of course.</p></li></ul>",
